testors were reportedly being  arrested last night for breaking curfew, but white protestors were not.\n\n#BlackLivesMatter","userId":2416746925,"media":null,"username":"pcbrynn","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":2,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1268166228906033158,"date":1591189365000,"rawContent":"@winightcheese @JackFinnResists \ud83d\ude02\ud83d\ude02 I was proud to see Mars Cheese Castle stand up for #BlackLivesMatter!  At least there is that?! \ud83e\udd37\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u2640\ufe0f","userId":2416746925,"media":null,"username":"pcbrynn","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":3,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":3.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1268528732962205696,"date":1591275792000,"rawContent":"Two kids are playing. One falls and scrapes his knee. Do you give both kids a bandage? Of course not - you give it to the kid who is bleeding. Does that mean the other kid doesn\u2019t matter? Also no. \n\nThere - I hope this helps. \n#BlackLivesMatter","userId":2416746925,"media":null,"username":"pcbrynn","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":4,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":4.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1268973529640435718,"date":1591381840000,"rawContent":"Remember when MAGAs were threatening and screaming at police officers to let them inside state buildings....\n\n#BlackLivesMatter","userId":2416746925,"media":null,"username":"pcbrynn","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":5,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":5.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1268979399195582465,"date":1591383239000,"rawContent":"The racial disparities that we are witnessing in the police system is also happening in schools. \n\nBlack children are twice as likely to be suspended from school than their white peers.  \n\nWe need to change the system. \n#BlackLivesMatter","userId":2416746925,"media":null,"username":"pcbrynn","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":6,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":6.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1269383607229046785,"date":1591479610000,"rawContent":"It\u2019s not enough to just not be a racist.  Change will only happen if we are anti-racist. \n\nSpeak up.  Speak out. Speak truth. \n\n#BlackLivesMatter","userId":2416746925,"media":null,"username":"pcbrynn","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":7.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1269643776961765381,"date":1591541639000,"rawContent":"We need to keep it up and have a #BlackLivesMatter Avenue in every major city across the country... not just DC.","userId":2416746925,"media":null,"username"